---
description: Distinguish desired result from proposed implementation and authority.
args:{projects:RequirementsProject[];records:EvidencePage[]}
returns:PositionClassification[]
---
For each stakeholder statement extract the desired outcome, rationale, suggested solution, explicit constraints, conditions and release phase. Strength is mandatory only when supported by an authorized in-scope source; otherwise classify preference or unknown. Preserve source evidence references and disputes.
